  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The figure represents the momentum time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>)</mo></math> curve for a particle moving along an axis under the influence of the force. Identify the regions on the graph where the magnitude of the force is maximum and minimum respectively ?</p><p>If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/05eaffdb-8170-4080-bb0e-26c6664da388-9895372.PNG\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 241px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
